- A HIGH level of about 3.3 V from the PIR is high enough to be recognized as HIGH by the ATmega328P digital input used on the Uno.
- Because the signal is going from the PIR into an input, no level shifter or series resistor is required just to translate 3.3 V logic to the Uno input.
